      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should ask the doctor but i can't get an appointment for another two weeks and the pain is really getting to me. i've taken advil before and never had an issue. surely a single 200mg pill isn't going to do anything crazy? i just need some relief so i can sleep tonight.",
